  "v": "Hello! My name is Rayhaan. Thank you for checking out my portfolio!"
 },
 {
  "t": "p",
  "lvl": 0,
  "v": "I graduated with a degree in Mechanical Engineering from Harvard College in 2025. I'm grateful to have grown as an engineer through amazing experiences both on and off campus. This journey can be seen through the various tabs and projects within this portfolio."
 },
 {
  "t": "p",
  "lvl": 0,
  "v": "While I enjoy tackling new challenges, I have an especial interest in things automotive. My senior year, I founded Harvard's first Formula SAE team and served as President; managing the integration of mine and several other senior capstone projects to form the infrastructure of the car. In conjunction, the club foundation, organization and mentorship was established to further integrate underclassmen level projects with the vehicle. I continue to serve the team as an advisor."
 },
 {
